      "releaseNotes": "IMPORT MAP LAYERS\nBring your spots into Hawaii Ocean Map from KML, KMZ, or GPX files — exports from Google Earth, Navionics, Garmin, and most chartplotters and fishing apps all work. Each file becomes its own map layer of points, lines, and areas that you can rename, show or hide, and tap for details — synced across your devices with iCloud.\n\nNEW FISHING STORE\nWest Maui Sports & Fishing Supply's new Lahaina flagship added to the fishing stores layer.",
